# Membership bodies CRM

Use this when researching, scoring, ranking, or adding UK membership bodies in the Notion CRM. Do not use it for Tally form copy, Gmail outreach drafts, or Surveyor code. Outreach letter copy lives in `brand.mdc`.

Migrated from the Notion skill [Research and rank membership bodies](https://app.notion.com/p/3d4ec77522dd8141baaccd658a4e3657). Follow this Cursor rule, not that page.

## When this applies

The database is the primary marketing and survey CRM. One row = one organisation. Research, outreach, and later survey results live on the same page.

Do **not** create a second contacts or survey database.

